{"type":"message","id":"bb2b019a","parentId":"1d7d8f3b","timestamp":"2026-04-04T22:01:02.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have all the information I need for the morning briefing. Let me compile it:\n\n1. Weather: ⛅ Seoul +7°C (feels like +6°C), ↑5km/h wind, 93% humidity\n2. System status: 6/8 cron jobs healthy, 2 issues (daily-github-backup push failure, periodic-memory-maintenance error), 1 new error (daily-update-check Telegram delivery)\n3. Urgent notifications/tasks:\n   - GitHub backup push failure (403) - needs token/permission fix\n   - daily-update-check failing on Telegram delivery\n   - 2 CRITICAL security findings from 03:00 audit (Telegram open group runtime/filesystem tools exposure)\n   - Telegram open group permission settings need review\n\nThe briefing should be in Korean as per USER.md preferences.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"# 🌅 4월 5일 오전 7시 브리핑\n\n## 날씨 - 서울\n⛅ **7°C** (체감 6°C), ↑5km/h 바람, 습도 93%\n\n## 시스템 상태\n- **Cron 작업**: 8개 중 6개 건강, 2개 문제\n- **주요 이슈**: \n  - daily-github-backup: 푸시 실패 (Permission denied 403)\n  - periodic-memory-maintenance: MEMORY.md 편집 실패\n  - daily-update-check: Telegram 전송 실패 (대상 설정 누락)\n\n## 긴급 알림\n- 🔴 **보안 감사 CRITICAL (03:00)**: 2건 - Telegram open group에서 runtime/filesystem tools 노출\n- ⚠️ GitHub 백업: 로컬 커밋 성공했지만 원격 푸시 불가 (토큰/권한 필요)\n- ⚠️ Telegram open group 권한 설정 검토 필요\n\n_대상: Sam (Telegram)_"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":22,"output":599,"cacheRead":25561,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26182,"cost":{"input":0.000013199999999999999,"output":0.0013178,"cacheRead":0.0028117100000000003,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.004142710000000001}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775340043203,"responseId":"202604050600446803f63faa844d4e"}}
